** Founder 'own' is extremely strong** - 48.73% shareholding, considering business as a career, non-financial investor
** A sober self-awareness** - A very rare initiative to "stress brakes" at high growth (the 2026 guidelines are only 20%+)
** "Say No" culture** - Profits are given priority in terms of quality of association, wholesale, radical expansion and continued
** Globalization is not a low-cost dumping** — total direct, with a net profit rate of nearly 20 per cent abroad, a profitable globalization
** Fear of artists** - Without interfering with creation, the "record company" model makes artists' resources a real barrier
** Response to AI** - The positioning of "extreme Under-Screen Experience" was not reversed by AI but benefited from it

